<title>SPAIN: Spain June currency reserves rose $956.1 mln.</title>
<headline>Spain June currency reserves rose $956.1 mln.</headline>
<dateline>MADRID 1997-07-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Bank of Spain gave the following provisional figures (millions of dollars):</p>
<p> RESERVES		     JUNE 97	MAY 97    JUNE 96</p>
<p> Rise/fall in month	 956.1	  499.2    400.9</p>
<p> End-month total	 67,359.0     66,402.9   53,541.3</p>
<p>-- Madrid newsroom + 34 1 585 8340</p>
</text>
